        "id": 1956258
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-04T02:00:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "UpdateEngine is not a versioned interface like UpdateEngineStable,that is the reason https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:out/soong/.intermediates/frameworks/base/framework-minus-apex-intdefs/android_common/xref48/srcjars.xref/android/os/IUpdateEngineCallback.java;l\u003d26;drc\u003dc0ad42c2f997b6dc8c09f9ff739d7357595a4790. this interface doesn\u0027t have gethash and getVersion methods.\n\nBut the stable interface stub has unimplemented methods which need to be implemented in call like this: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/UpdateEngine.java;l\u003d262;drc\u003dc0ad42c2f997b6dc8c09f9ff739d7357595a4790",
      "parentUuid": "40cae8d7_eab6d18d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 138,
        "startChar": 35,
        "endLine": 138,
        "endChar": 39
      },
      "revId": "2776ba8ed96630c7ad9eb3149dfb9e2559048312",
